Cell["\<\
(128*BF*z*(2 + z + 2*z2 - 4*z4 - z5 + 2*z2*(5 + 2*z + \
z2)*log(z))*mypow(CF,-1)*mypow(Nc,-2)*mypow(1 - z,-2)*
     mypow(1 + z,-3))/3.\
\>", "Output",
